# Rabbit Hole — environment variables
#
# Nothing here is required to run locally: without these, `npm run dev` keeps
# accounts in .data/local-db.json on your machine.
#
# To use the SAME database as your Vercel deployment (your real accounts):
#   1. npx vercel login
#   2. npx vercel link            (pick the rabbit-hole project)
#   3. npx vercel env pull .env.local
# …or copy the values from Vercel → Storage → your Upstash database → .env.local tab.

# Upstash Redis (either pair works — the Vercel integration may add both)
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
# KV_REST_API_URL=
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
